[gd_scene load_steps=8 format=3]

; The one variable: a precomposed character the font lacks, which a Label3D and a TextMesh draw as
; its base and marks (hb-ot-shape-normalize.cc), the marks at the offsets of the font's GPOS. The
; font holds basic Latin and the combining marks U+0300 to U+0308, U+030A and U+0323, and none of
; the precomposed characters of them. The last two TextMeshes draw the same text in copies of the
; font with no GPOS script, which HarfBuzz places by its fallback (hb-ot-shape-fallback.cc), and with
; a GPOS that has no mark lookup, which leaves each mark at its pen position.

